# Showcase Demo Cutscene
# Demonstrates full capabilities of the editor with backdrops, cutins, portraits, and sound effects

@backdrop data:castle_hall [fadeIn=500]
@char ALDEN sprite=characters/male
@char KNIGHT sprite=npc/air-knight

ALDEN: [expression=happy,position=left] Welcome to this demo!
*ALDEN: [cutin=size=large,expression=happy]
"""
Let's show you the full capabilities of this editor.
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/brass-loop.mp3]

KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right] I will stand by you.

ALDEN: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
Notice the backdrop, portraits, and cutins are fully integrated,
and sound effects play when triggered.
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

*KNIGHT: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
This cutin sprite appears large and expressive.
"""

wait 1500

ALDEN: [expression=sad,position=left] Sometimes, emotions run deep...

@backdrop data:castle_courtyard [fadeIn=1000]

ALDEN: [expression=worried,position=left] Look at the courtyard backdrop now.

@do playSfx [name=audio/ocean-waves.mp3]

KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right] Sounds of waves soothe the soul.

waitInput

@end
